  "articleBody": "Before requesting proposals for a living room addition, define how the room will be used, measure the existing home, collect property information, and prepare questions about design, permits, construction, and project coordination. A useful consultation should produce a clearer scope, identify conditions that may affect the design, and explain which decisions must be made before construction begins.",
